==Battleground==
*1 [[Snache]] spawns.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[The 4th Angel (Enemy)|The 4th Angel]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

